# Network Dashboard
Flask Web Server, allows users to view devices on network

## Getting Started
Install all Dependencies in [dependencies.txt](#dependencies-txt) as well as the followoing:
1. [Nmap](https://nmap.org/download.html)  

2. [Npcap](https://npcap.com/)  
    NOTE: If you install Npcap with Nmap, this step is not needed

3. python virtual environment (recommended):
```bash
python -m venv venv_name
venv_name\Scripts\activate
pip install -r dependencies.txt
```
